//! Builds the app with an app manifest: each command below gets an `allow-<command>` permission
//! (generated under permissions/autogenerated/), and a window can call only the commands its
//! capability grants (capabilities/*.json, through the sets in permissions/windows.toml).
//! Without a manifest every window could call every command.

